    "By reason of its  siting, scale, form, bulk and  massing, it is considered that proposal for 245 Kings Road would result in overdevelopment of the application site and would have an unacceptable adverse impact on the character and appearance of the host dwelling as well as within the immediate surrounding area and therefore be contrary to Policy D3 of London Plan 2012, Policies CS8 and DM10 in the Core Strategy (2012) and Residential Design SPD (2013).",
    "By reason of its siting and combined height and depth along the boundary, the proposed two storey side  extension element of the proposal is considered to have an overbearing impact and result in an undue sense of enclosure and  loss of daylight  to the neighbouring property at no 243 Kings Road and is thereby contrary to Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021,  Policies CS8 and DM10 of the Core Strategy (2012) and Residential Design SPD (2013)"
